{"publicId":"a1884b61-415d-4c0a-9cac-86f993992180","title":"ArtCraft开源工具克隆Adobe产品并获高下载量","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-13T04:17:25.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-13T04:17:25.000Z","digest":"ArtCraft发布开源工具PhotoCraft（克隆Photoshop）和PdfCraft（克隆Acrobat），社区下载量达1.7百万/天，团队称AI生成代码实现60%功能对齐。报道指出，ArtCraft早先尝试Electron框架但发现高质创意应用需原生支持，后转向Rust语言开发，团队称Rust可能是成功关键。目前未开源AutoCraft平台，但团队宣布将发布自主开发平台并倡导互联网开源愿景。\n\n分歧点在于技术路径：早先报道强调Electron框架的局限性，认为原生开发是必要条件；后续报道则突出Rust语言在性能和稳定性上的优势，但未提供具体技术指标对比。\n\n影响范围覆盖全球创意设计领域，尤其针对无法负担Adobe订阅费用的用户群体，但尚未披露商业合作或生态整合计划。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-13T21:51:53.746Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"ArtCraft克隆Photoshop及Acrobat开启‘重建一切’开源计划","latestReport":{"id":"xdw5wr4jyfb4qhwozscsgvz8o"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fUeTRCq1gky8","title":"ArtCraft 发布 PhotoCraft 和 PdfCraft","firstReportAt":"2026-11-13T04:17:25.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"xdw5wr4jyfb4qhwozscsgvz8o","title":"ArtCraft克隆Photoshop及Acrobat开启‘重建一切’开源计划","summary":"ArtCraft发布开源工具克隆Adobe Photoshop及Acrobat，社区下载量达1.7百万/天。团队通过AI生成代码实现60%功能对齐，并计划开源自主开发平台AutoCraft，倡导‘重建一切’的互联网开源愿景。","source":{"name":"Latent Space","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T04:17:25.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"xdw5wr4jyfb4qhwozscsgvz8o","title":"ArtCraft克隆Photoshop及Acrobat开启‘重建一切’开源计划","summary":"ArtCraft发布开源工具克隆Adobe Photoshop及Acrobat，社区下载量达1.7百万/天。团队通过AI生成代码实现60%功能对齐，并计划开源自主开发平台AutoCraft，倡导‘重建一切’的互联网开源愿景。","source":{"name":"Latent Space","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T04:17:25.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-13T22:00:00.000Z","heat":6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T23:00:00.000Z","heat":5.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T00:00:00.000Z","heat":5.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z","heat":5.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T07:00:00.000